  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lhyLOTO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"464\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>Mirabilis：原版生態域全面翻新</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"font-size:12px\">Mirabilis 是一個全面翻新</strong><span style=\"font-weight:600\">Minecraft 與 BYG</span><strong style=\"font-size:12px\"> 每個生態域的模組</strong>，並在不破壞 Minecraft 理念的前提下添加各種植被。它新增了新的樹木、石造結構、落葉地毯、更多草叢，以及 4 種新的生態域變體：</p><p>茂密沙丘、枯死沙丘、茂密森林、茂密雪原。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組可與 BOP、BYG 及其他生態域模組完美相容。<br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>圖片：</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ATd5U7p.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"714\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ocIBEa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"714\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e7iBPe5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"714\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cz8hrgW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"714\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZPb7h9q.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZTQWYid.png\"></p>",
